Dialogue: 10,0:00:06.93,0:00:10.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari adakan turnamen bela diri\Nyang bisa diikuti penonton!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:11.69,0:00:13.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Turnamen bela diri!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:13.52,0:00:14.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu artinya...
Dialogue: 10,0:00:14.86,0:00:17.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Turnamen bela diri penuh darah
Dialogue: 10,0:00:17.25,0:00:19.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,tempat orang-orang kuat\Nsekerajaan saling bertarung?!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:19.50,0:00:20.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:20.92,0:00:23.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kita mengajak\Npara murid Akademi Altoire ikut serta
Dialogue: 10,0:00:24.00,0:00:25.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan menggelar turnamen bela diri.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:26.19,0:00:27.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:28.03,0:00:31.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berarti tidak ada pertarungan berdarah, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:31.57,0:00:33.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau ini berharap apa, sih?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:34.14,0:00:37.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudmu memanfaatkan\Nkasih sayang orang tua pada anaknya
Dialogue: 10,0:00:37.28,0:00:40.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk menaikkan kepopuleran\NMagic Vision, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:00:40.65,0:00:42.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat juga, Hilde.\NCerdik sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:42.64,0:00:44.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia! Jaga bicaramu!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:44.14,0:00:45.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:45.29,0:00:47.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang-orang dari stasiun penyiaran\Njuga bilang
Dialogue: 10,0:00:47.24,0:00:49.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalau aku licik.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:50.18,0:00:52.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Acara sekolah isinya anak kecil.\N- Begitu ke anak delapan tahun!
Dialogue: 10,0:00:52.53,0:00:53.64,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Acara sekolah isinya anak kecil.\N- Keterlaluan banget.
Dialogue: 10,0:00:53.89,0:00:56.43,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin ada orang kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:30.66,0:02:32.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, siapa bocah itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:32.12,0:02:34.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Shh! Kalau sampai bertatapan mata,\Nkita bakal dihajar!
Dialogue: 10,0:02:35.12,0:02:36.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selamat datang, Lily.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:37.91,0:02:39.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah lama, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:40.15,0:02:42.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih. Kau peka juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:45.37,0:02:46.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini bukan alkohol.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:46.65,0:02:48.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jelaslah.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:48.21,0:02:50.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku kan pelanggan tetap,\Ntidak masalah, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:50.43,0:02:54.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lalu, sudah ketemu orang\Nyang mau bertarung denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:02:54.44,0:02:56.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya sudah tidak ada yang mau lagi.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:56.83,0:02:58.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sama kau juga tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:02:58.58,0:03:00.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:00.18,0:03:03.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berapa kali pun dicoba,\Naku tidak punya peluang menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:03.34,0:03:06.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, bar ini sudah jadi pekerjaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:06.75,0:03:08.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan bicara begitu, dong.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:08.53,0:03:11.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo bersama-sama menuju\Njalan kejayaan berdarah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:11.41,0:03:14.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau jalan berbahaya begitu,\Njalani saja sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:14.16,0:03:16.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa tidak ada orang yang kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:16.46,0:03:19.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Melawan monster pun tidak apa-apa, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:19.13,0:03:21.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada satu cerita menarik.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:21.63,0:03:23.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pernah dengar Arena Tarung Gelap?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:24.09,0:03:25.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Arena Tarung Gelap?!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:25.78,0:03:28.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Seperti dugaanmu,\Narena tarung ilegal di bawah tanah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:29.02,0:03:30.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya sebentar lagi ada acara.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:31.55,0:03:35.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Orang kaya yang bosan dan ingin melihat
Dialogue: 10,0:03:35.15,0:03:37.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,orang bertarung dan saling membunuh
Dialogue: 10,0:03:37.87,0:03:39.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan bertaruh pada jagoannya.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:40.27,0:03:41.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:03:41.74,0:03:43.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa baru bilang sekarang?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:43.74,0:03:45.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saking bagusnya sampai bikin sebal.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:45.87,0:03:47.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti kau bakal bilang mau ikut, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:03:47.74,0:03:49.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tebakanmu tepat.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:51.69,0:03:52.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mustahillah.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:52.68,0:03:54.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Identitasmu pasti langsung ketahuan,
Dialogue: 10,0:03:55.02,0:03:56.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Kecil Keluarga Liston.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:57.34,0:03:59.21,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu memang bahaya, sih.
Dialogue: 10,0:03:59.52,0:04:01.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku memberitahumu agar kau tidak gegabah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:01.74,0:04:03.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau kau dengar dari tempat lain,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:03.56,0:04:06.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu gegabah ikut dan bikin keributan,
Dialogue: 10,0:04:06.46,0:04:08.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,keluarga Liston bisa hancur, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:09.22,0:04:10.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:10.11,0:04:13.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal Magic Vision harus\Ndisebarkan sekarang.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:13.06,0:04:15.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu tidak boleh sampai terganggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:16.52,0:04:18.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, aku ingin ikut!\NPokoknya mau!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:18.64,0:04:20.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah kasih peringatan, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:20.93,0:04:22.30,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh iya, Fressa.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:29.74,0:04:30.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sedang apa kau?
Dialogue: 10,0:04:30.86,0:04:33.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku sudah meyakinkan pelayanku\Nagar bisa pergi sendiri.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:33.81,0:04:36.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona mau ke mana?\NSaya juga ikut!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:36.95,0:04:37.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak usah.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:38.02,0:04:40.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau lihat-lihat pakaian dalam\Nnorak sendirian.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:42.50,0:04:44.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, pakaian dalammu tidak norak.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:45.13,0:04:47.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Celana dalammu lumayan imut.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:47.32,0:04:48.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:48.68,0:04:51.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin dia paham!
Dialogue: 10,0:04:51.08,0:04:53.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hei, jangan berbuat mesum di barku.
Dialogue: 10,0:04:53.94,0:04:56.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf, ya. Sampai jumpa.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:00.48,0:05:02.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona, barusan Anda bilang apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:02.94,0:05:04.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau tampil di Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:04.94,0:05:06.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya tidak dengar jelas.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:07.01,0:05:08.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Boleh ulangi sekali lagi?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:08.91,0:05:11.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kubilang aku mau ikut acara\NArena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:11.69,0:05:13.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini sudah yang ketiga kali.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:13.68,0:05:16.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau saya menangis memohon,\Napa Anda akan menyerah?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:17.08,0:05:19.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan tetap tampil di Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:19.73,0:05:21.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya adukan ke ayah Anda, lo!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:21.79,0:05:23.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku akan pura-pura tidak ikut.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:23.80,0:05:25.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda bukan anak kecil,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:25.42,0:05:27.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,tolong jangan egois!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:27.19,0:05:29.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dilihat dari mana pun, aku anak kecil.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:31.69,0:05:35.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula, Anda dapat informasi soal\NArena Tarung Gelap itu dari mana?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:35.93,0:05:37.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saluran wilayah Liston sekarang
Dialogue: 10,0:05:38.01,0:05:41.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,bertahan berkat kepopuleran Anda\Nsebagai anak polos!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:43.36,0:05:44.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anda mengerti, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:05:44.94,0:05:46.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku paham soal itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:05:46.93,0:05:49.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku tetap ingin tampil\Ndi Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:50.72,0:05:51.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:51.88,0:05:53.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya Anda paham!
Dialogue: 10,0:05:54.12,0:05:55.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak akan bertarung.
Dialogue: 10,0:05:55.83,0:05:57.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma pergi menonton saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:02.58,0:06:04.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau pergi atau tidak...
Dialogue: 10,0:06:04.83,0:06:07.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mau bertarung atau tidak,\Npokok masalahnya bukan di situ!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:10.22,0:06:12.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma nonton, kok. Janji.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:16.00,0:06:16.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:18.06,0:06:20.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Waktunya persiapan\Nturnamen bela diri akademi!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:20.74,0:06:25.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari bahas pendaftaran peserta\Ndan promosi acaranya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:33.56,0:06:34.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dua minggu lagi,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:35.04,0:06:37.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,turnamen bela diri untuk menentukan
Dialogue: 10,0:06:37.89,0:06:39.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,siapa yang terkuat\Ndi akademi ini akan digelar!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:40.76,0:06:44.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pesertanya adalah murid SD dan SMP.
Dialogue: 10,0:06:45.13,0:06:47.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jalannya turnamen ini
Dialogue: 10,0:06:47.04,0:06:50.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,disiarkan lewat Magic Vision\Nke seluruh Kerajaan Altoire!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:50.99,0:06:53.06,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kru kameranya juga murid,
Dialogue: 10,0:06:53.10,0:06:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,kita sendiri yang membuat acaranya!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:55.38,0:06:57.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari kita ramaikan turnamennya bersama-sama!
Dialogue: 10,0:06:57.81,0:06:59.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Harus berusaha, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:00.35,0:07:02.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini memang beda dari harapanku,
Dialogue: 10,0:07:02.62,0:07:05.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi acara ini harus sukses.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:06.20,0:07:09.12,dialog - atas,,0,0,0,,Jadi, mereka ini kru kameranya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:09.70,0:07:12.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak salah, begini...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:12.69,0:07:13.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:13.70,0:07:15.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aduh!\N- Ah, maaf!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:15.45,0:07:16.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak apa-apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:16.42,0:07:17.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,Benaran bakal lancar, nih?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:18.00,0:07:19.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:20.75,0:07:24.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sutradara kenalanku yang ekspresinya\Nselalu kaku pernah bilang begini.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:24.33,0:07:26.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,"Santai saja! Santai!"
Dialogue: 10,0:07:27.00,0:07:29.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kalau sampai gagal...
Dialogue: 10,0:07:29.27,0:07:31.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti bisa diakali waktu penyuntingan.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:31.88,0:07:33.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gagal pun tidak apa-apa.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:33.87,0:07:36.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Malah, anggap saja kita pasti gagal.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:36.35,0:07:38.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Itu akan jadi pengalaman bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:38.45,0:07:40.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia benar.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:40.54,0:07:42.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayo terus coba sampai terbiasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:42.73,0:07:43.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Baik!\N- Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:07:50.29,0:07:52.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya sedang wawancara para peserta, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:07:52.80,0:07:53.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakanda.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:54.98,0:07:57.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rencananya akan disiarkan sebelum turnamen.
Dialogue: 10,0:07:57.12,0:08:01.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tu-Tuan Neil juga mau ikut\Nturnamen bela diri?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:02.44,0:08:04.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebenarnya, aku masih ragu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:04.89,0:08:06.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa kau ikut serta, Nia?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:06.80,0:08:08.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak ikut.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:09.54,0:08:11.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu, aku mau coba.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:12.10,0:08:14.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak pernah menang darimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:14.38,0:08:15.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan khawatir.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:15.68,0:08:18.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Paras Kakanda jauh lebih imut.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:18.42,0:08:20.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak sedang membahas paras, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:20.68,0:08:21.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:21.70,0:08:23.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,bagaimana kalau kita\Nmewawancarai Tuan Neil saja?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:24.12,0:08:25.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aku?\N- Benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:26.02,0:08:27.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau orang seperti Kakanda ikut serta,
Dialogue: 10,0:08:27.94,0:08:30.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Magic Vision bakal laris manis!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:32.00,0:08:33.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak dulu, deh.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:34.03,0:08:35.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku canggung soal hal begi...
Dialogue: 10,0:08:35.05,0:08:36.96,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakanda, kumohon!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:37.00,0:08:40.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ini langkah awal kesuksesan\Nsyuting di akademi!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:40.94,0:08:42.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Tolonglah!\N- Kami mohon!
Dialogue: 10,0:08:44.39,0:08:46.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ba-Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:47.37,0:08:48.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Neil Liston.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:48.65,0:08:50.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mempelajari Seni Pedang Cepat Satomi.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:50.88,0:08:52.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Begitu, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:52.24,0:08:53.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari mana asalmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:08:53.94,0:08:55.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wilayah Liston.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:55.25,0:08:59.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tumbuh di pulau terapung\Nmilik ayahku, Ornit Liston.
Dialogue: 10,0:08:59.17,0:09:00.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Aduh! Apaan, sih?\N- Seni Pedang Cepat Satomi itu
Dialogue: 10,0:09:00.61,0:09:02.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Relia, bagaimana menurutmu?\N- ilmu pedang seperti apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:02.26,0:09:03.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Menurutku?\N- ilmu pedang seperti apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:03.39,0:09:04.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Baik Nona Hilde maupun Tuan Neil,\N- Aliran yang fokus ke kecepatan
Dialogue: 10,0:09:05.01,0:09:06.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,- bicara dengan natural.\N- serta ketepatan.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:06.72,0:09:07.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Justru itu.\N- Mencari celah,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:08.02,0:09:10.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Obrolannya memang bagus,\N- lalu menebas secepatnya
Dialogue: 10,0:09:10.20,0:09:13.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,- tapi harus ada aksi mencolok, 'kan?\N- Apa ada rival yang
Dialogue: 10,0:09:13.12,0:09:14.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Eh, apa iya?\N- ingin kau kalahkan?
Dialogue: 10,0:09:14.58,0:09:16.78,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertanyaan bagus, aku selalu...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:21.05,0:09:22.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Neil, hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:09:24.96,0:09:26.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berkat ide dari Nia,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:26.75,0:09:28.99,dialog,,0,0,0,,kita berhasil dapat gambar bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:29.64,0:09:30.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakanda.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:31.71,0:09:35.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gerakanmu jauh lebih baik daripada dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:35.35,0:09:36.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:36.13,0:09:39.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Soalnya aku harus melindungi adikku\Nyang baru masuk sekolah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:40.76,0:09:42.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakanda ini lucu sekali, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:42.94,0:09:45.19,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kudoakan semoga Kakanda menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:45.36,0:09:46.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm? Ya...
Dialogue: 10,0:09:46.96,0:09:49.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku merasa kalau ucapan itu agak meremehkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:09:49.82,0:09:51.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi aku akan berusaha.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:51.36,0:09:54.57,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wawancara Tuan Neil lancar, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:54.74,0:09:55.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:55.75,0:09:58.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penggemar Kakanda pasti bertambah.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:58.45,0:09:59.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, benar juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:09:59.40,0:10:02.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus kasih tahu Ayah dan Ibu\Nkalau Kakanda ikut.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:02.89,0:10:04.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Syukurlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:04.46,0:10:07.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kelihatannya Anda sangat semangat\Nmenyambut turnamen.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:12.34,0:10:13.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ada apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:13.67,0:10:16.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak mengira kalau aku sudah puas
Dialogue: 10,0:10:16.47,0:10:18.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,dengan turnamen bela diri akademi, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:19.01,0:10:20.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:21.10,0:10:22.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memangnya salah?
Dialogue: 10,0:10:22.72,0:10:25.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya pikir Anda sudah melupakan\Nsoal Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:25.47,0:10:27.11,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:27.49,0:10:30.07,dialog,,0,0,0,,Saya tidak ingat pernah menyetujuinya.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:30.11,0:10:33.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku sudah menahan diri\Ndengan cuma menonton, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:33.77,0:10:35.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murid keras kepala.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:35.99,0:10:37.16,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia harus
Dialogue: 10,0:10:38.37,0:10:39.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,kuberi sedikit pelajaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:40.72,0:10:43.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murid jangan membangkang\Nterhadap keputusan guru!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:43.15,0:10:47.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sebelum jadi guru saya,\NAnda itu putri keluarga Liston!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:47.07,0:10:49.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin saya membiarkan Anda\Npergi ke tempat seperti itu!
Dialogue: 10,0:10:52.58,0:10:54.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Murid ini kuat sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:10:55.12,0:10:56.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lagi pula...
Dialogue: 10,0:10:56.50,0:10:58.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apa rencana Anda untuk masuk
Dialogue: 10,0:10:58.46,0:11:01.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,ke Arena Tarung Gelap yang ilegal?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:01.22,0:11:03.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tinggal menyamar saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:03.30,0:11:04.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski menyamar,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:05.01,0:11:07.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,itu bukan tempat yang bisa\Ndidatangi anak-anak!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:07.48,0:11:10.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti kupikirkan caranya, deh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:10.25,0:11:11.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:12.58,0:11:13.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:13.61,0:11:14.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:14.32,0:11:15.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya mau pergi!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:15.69,0:11:16.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pokoknya tidak boleh!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:28.65,0:11:31.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih baik kau minta maaf, Nia.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:31.17,0:11:32.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:32.04,0:11:34.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pasti kau yang bicara aneh-aneh.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:34.74,0:11:36.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau anggap aku apa, Relia?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:36.77,0:11:37.65,dialog,,0,0,0,,Relia!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:38.38,0:11:39.42,dialog,,0,0,0,,Relia.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:39.47,0:11:42.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tinggalkan Aliran Tenha,\Nmasuk saja ke dojo pedang kami.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:42.38,0:11:43.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenalanmu?
Dialogue: 10,0:11:43.41,0:11:44.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan kenalan,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:44.90,0:11:46.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,malahan mereka sering menggangguku.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:46.38,0:11:48.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sebelahmu itu Nia Liston, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:48.82,0:11:49.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pas banget,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:49.94,0:11:51.95,dialog,,0,0,0,,sekalian ikut Relia ke dojo kami!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:52.34,0:11:53.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari ini hentikan dulu,
Dialogue: 10,0:11:54.15,0:11:56.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia tidak seharusnya terlibat!
Dialogue: 10,0:11:56.39,0:11:58.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Wah, perhatian sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:58.05,0:11:59.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasanya ingin kuberi uang jajan.
Dialogue: 10,0:11:59.38,0:12:00.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,Asal kalian tahu,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:00.42,0:12:02.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,aku bicara begini demi kebaikan kalian!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:02.53,0:12:04.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Lebih baik jangan terlibat dengan Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:06.03,0:12:07.83,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak ini berbahaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:07.87,0:12:08.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Relia?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:08.53,0:12:09.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Serius, bahaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:09.98,0:12:11.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Cepat pergi sana!\N- Hei, Relia?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:11.98,0:12:13.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Entah maksudmu apa,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:13.96,0:12:16.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi Aliran Tenha kan lemah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:16.54,0:12:19.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memakai senjata tentu lebih kuat\Ndaripada tangan kosong!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:20.62,0:12:21.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bicara apa kau barusan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:22.04,0:12:23.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah! Tunggu! Jangan bilang begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:12:23.82,0:12:27.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau bilang "pakai senjata lebih kuat", 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:27.20,0:12:28.39,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bisa pasang kuda-kuda?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:28.55,0:12:29.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:29.55,0:12:30.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cepatlah.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:39.65,0:12:41.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang senjatamu hilang,
Dialogue: 10,0:12:42.01,0:12:43.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,selanjutnya apa?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:46.33,0:12:47.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sudah cukup, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:47.58,0:12:48.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tunggu dulu.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:49.44,0:12:51.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tendanganmu tadi hebat sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:51.60,0:12:53.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Oh? Kau bisa melihatnya?
Dialogue: 10,0:12:53.47,0:12:55.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maaf atas ulah juniorku.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:55.98,0:12:57.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku Sanowill Baddor.
Dialogue: 10,0:12:57.67,0:12:59.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maukah kau bertanding denganku?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:00.26,0:13:01.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Sano!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.13,0:13:01.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Sano!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:01.98,0:13:03.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Anak ini lancang sekali!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:03.36,0:13:04.44,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Hajar saja dia!\N- Kalian ini,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:04.48,0:13:05.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,jagalah sopan santun.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:06.70,0:13:08.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku tidak akan membuang waktumu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:08.19,0:13:10.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku cuma ingin tahu seberapa kuat dirimu.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:10.76,0:13:11.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:12.37,0:13:14.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau siap kalah di depan juniormu,
Dialogue: 10,0:13:14.82,0:13:16.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,mari bertanding sekarang juga.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:17.01,0:13:18.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia, bahaya!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:18.50,0:13:22.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sanowill itu juara turnamen\Nklub akademi musim gugur lalu!
Dialogue: 10,0:13:37.23,0:13:39.97,dialog,,0,0,0,,Sekarang kami ada jadwal syuting.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:40.19,0:13:41.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Permisi.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:50.86,0:13:53.35,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tolong ceritakan tekadmu\Nuntuk menyabet gelar juara.
Dialogue: 10,0:13:53.38,0:13:54.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Apanya yang juara?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:54.89,0:13:58.12,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal jelas-jelas ada junior\Nyang lebih kuat dariku...
Dialogue: 10,0:13:58.41,0:13:59.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maksudnya apa, ya?
Dialogue: 10,0:13:59.95,0:14:02.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia! Bertandinglah melawanku\Nsekali lagi!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:02.39,0:14:04.20,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kali ini, akan kubaca gerakanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.24,0:14:04.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kumohon!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:04.90,0:14:06.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Sekali lagi saja!\N- Nia.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:06.34,0:14:07.87,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Nanti kita tanding di dojo!\N- Apa yang sudah kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:07.90,0:14:08.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Hari ini juga boleh!\N- Apa yang sudah kau lakukan?
Dialogue: 10,0:14:11.15,0:14:12.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Setelah itu,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:12.29,0:14:14.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,kami terus syuting,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:17.75,0:14:20.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan antusiasme turnamen bela diri\Nmakin terasa.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:23.27,0:14:24.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya besok, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:27.04,0:14:28.41,dialog,,0,0,0,,Persiapan sudah selesai,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:28.46,0:14:30.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,tinggal berharap pada peserta.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:31.10,0:14:33.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Responsnya luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:33.10,0:14:36.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Banyak pertanyaan dari orang tua\Nmurid sesuai target kita.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:36.98,0:14:40.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Katanya kristal sihir di wilayahku\Njuga mulai terjual.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:40.19,0:14:42.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Memanfaatkan anak-anak
Dialogue: 10,0:14:42.37,0:14:44.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,untuk menyebarkan Magic Vision\Nberjalan lancar, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:44.53,0:14:45.70,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia! Jaga bicaramu!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:46.00,0:14:46.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Iya!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:47.20,0:14:48.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Makin sayang orang tua pada anaknya,
Dialogue: 10,0:14:48.52,0:14:52.36,dialog,,0,0,0,,makin rela mereka keluar uang banyak\Ndemi melihat sang anak.
Dialogue: 10,0:14:52.39,0:14:54.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona Hilde juga jangan bicara sembarangan!
Dialogue: 10,0:14:56.79,0:15:00.04,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, benar juga.\NOrang tuaku mengirim surat.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:02.85,0:15:05.34,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semoga Tuan Neil bisa menang.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:17.69,0:15:18.62,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kak Neil!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:18.65,0:15:20.05,dialog,,0,0,0,,Akhirnya tiba saatnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:20.10,0:15:22.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan gugup, santai saja!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:22.53,0:15:23.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:23.67,0:15:26.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya, terima kasih telah menunggu!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:26.40,0:15:28.86,dialog,,0,0,0,,Turnamen Bela Diri Akademi Altoire
Dialogue: 10,0:15:28.89,0:15:30.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,akhirnya resmi dimulai!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:33.67,0:15:36.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Di sini tempat peserta menunggu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:36.62,0:15:38.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Semuanya tampak sangat bersemangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:39.74,0:15:42.92,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pertama, kategori senjata,\Npertandingan pertama!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:48.63,0:15:49.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Terima kasih atas kerja kerasmu.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:49.67,0:15:51.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tuan Neil, berjuanglah!
Dialogue: 10,0:15:52.17,0:15:54.55,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau sampai kalah lawan dia,\Nbakal repot, nih.
Dialogue: 10,0:15:56.05,0:15:56.76,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:04.66,0:16:05.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berhasil!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:05.64,0:16:06.49,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cukup!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:06.52,0:16:08.13,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemenangnya Neil Liston!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:09.27,0:16:12.02,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hm, sudah sewajarnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:12.45,0:16:14.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Berikutnya, kategori tangan kosong.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:14.45,0:16:17.25,dialog,,0,0,0,,Inilah penampilan Lilimi Silver\Nyang paling dinantikan!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:17.40,0:16:18.72,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:18.91,0:16:20.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Imutnya!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:23.01,0:16:24.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kenapa cuma Nia?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:25.62,0:16:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus! Majulah!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:27.03,0:16:27.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:30.46,0:16:31.37,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cukup!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:32.89,0:16:33.89,dialog,,0,0,0,,Siap!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:34.35,0:16:36.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ayunda!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.00,0:16:44.80,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cukup!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:44.85,0:16:46.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemenangnya Neil Liston!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:48.86,0:16:50.28,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hebat!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:54.15,0:16:55.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia!
Dialogue: 10,0:16:55.54,0:16:57.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana pertandinganku tadi?
Dialogue: 10,0:16:57.50,0:16:59.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jujur saja, Kakanda melampaui ekspektasiku.
Dialogue: 10,0:16:59.58,0:17:02.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, berikutnya tidak akan mudah.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:03.53,0:17:04.46,dialog,,0,0,0,,Meski begitu,
Dialogue: 10,0:17:04.63,0:17:07.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,ada kata-katamu yang selalu kuingat.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:12.50,0:17:14.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya perempat final!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:14.97,0:17:18.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,Neil Liston dari Seni Pedang Cepat Satomi
Dialogue: 10,0:17:18.76,0:17:22.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,melawan juara turnamen klub tahun lalu,\NSanowill Baddor!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:25.35,0:17:27.10,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nia, lihatlah aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:17:33.27,0:17:34.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kedua pihak, bersiap!
Dialogue: 10,0:17:43.92,0:17:44.74,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mulai!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:02.01,0:18:04.38,dialog,,0,0,0,,- Awal yang lumayan.\N- Semangat!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:04.42,0:18:05.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi...
Dialogue: 10,0:18:07.77,0:18:08.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau terus begini,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:08.98,0:18:11.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,staminanya akan terkuras.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:29.58,0:18:30.32,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dia bertahan!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:30.36,0:18:32.69,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagus, inilah penentuannya!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:35.73,0:18:36.94,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakanda,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:36.98,0:18:38.75,dialog,,0,0,0,,pedang itu digunakan\Ndengan cara didorong dan ditarik,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:38.79,0:18:40.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,lalu ditebaskan dengan bilahnya.
Dialogue: 10,0:18:41.03,0:18:42.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan dipukulkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:44.05,0:18:44.93,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ditebas!
Dialogue: 10,0:18:49.81,0:18:51.81,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan dipukulkan,
Dialogue: 10,0:18:52.15,0:18:52.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,tapi ditebas!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:04.11,0:19:05.08,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selesai!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:05.65,0:19:07.56,dialog,,0,0,0,,Pemenangnya Sanowill Baddor!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:08.31,0:19:10.60,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kemenangan untuk Sanowill!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:10.96,0:19:13.71,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal Tuan Neil sudah berjuang keras.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:14.22,0:19:16.54,dialog,,0,0,0,,Penampilan Neil juga luar biasa!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:16.58,0:19:18.67,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tepuk tangan meriah untuk keduanya!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:20.30,0:19:23.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kategori tangan kosong,\Ndimenangkan Lilimi Silver
Dialogue: 10,0:19:24.22,0:19:27.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,dan kategori senjata dimenangkan\Noleh Sanowill Baddor!
Dialogue: 10,0:19:38.27,0:19:40.48,dialog,,0,0,0,,Padahal aku ingin pamer padamu.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:40.96,0:19:42.14,dialog,,0,0,0,,Maafkan aku.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:43.74,0:19:44.82,dialog,,0,0,0,,Performa yang hebat.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:45.00,0:19:46.61,dialog,,0,0,0,,Gerakan Kakanda bagus sekali.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:50.09,0:19:51.50,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau itu
Dialogue: 10,0:19:51.96,0:19:54.33,dialog,,0,0,0,,kadang suka sok menggurui, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:19:59.15,0:20:00.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tebasan yang bagus.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:01.09,0:20:04.01,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku menantikan dirimu yang akan makin kuat.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:05.77,0:20:06.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baik!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:13.25,0:20:14.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bagaimana turnamennya?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:15.15,0:20:17.15,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku lega karena berjalan lancar.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:17.41,0:20:19.24,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kakakku berjuang keras, lo.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:19.50,0:20:21.91,dialog,,0,0,0,,Jangan beri tahu hasilnya, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:21.95,0:20:24.03,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nanti saya lihat sendiri lewat siaran.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:24.52,0:20:27.00,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nona sendiri bagaimana?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:27.03,0:20:28.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Eh? Aku?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:29.11,0:20:32.22,dialog,,0,0,0,,Puas dengan turnamen bela diri akademi?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:32.22,0:20:33.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ah, iya.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:33.90,0:20:35.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata lebih seru daripada dugaanku.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:40.70,0:20:42.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Masih kurang.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:47.41,0:20:48.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dari mana dengar nama itu?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:49.49,0:20:52.26,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata kau memang tahu\Nsoal Arena Tarung Gelap.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:52.30,0:20:53.98,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bawa aku ke sana.
Dialogue: 10,0:20:54.15,0:20:56.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mana mungkin aku mau\Nbantu hal berisiko begitu!
Dialogue: 10,0:20:56.76,0:20:58.51,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kesampingkan itu,\Napa pelayanmu sedang luang?
Dialogue: 10,0:20:58.55,0:21:00.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku mau tanding ulang!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:00.74,0:21:02.31,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hari ini, dia tidak ikut.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:02.66,0:21:04.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalaupun ada, kau pasti kalah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:05.74,0:21:07.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Tapi, kalau kau mau membawaku,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:07.70,0:21:11.58,dialog,,0,0,0,,akan kuajarkan cara bertambah kuat\Nsetingkat lebih tinggi.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:11.63,0:21:12.53,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bersiaplah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:12.57,0:21:14.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bukan itu masalahnya...
Dialogue: 10,0:21:14.83,0:21:16.68,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak ingin bertambah kuat?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:16.72,0:21:18.45,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak ingin kekuatan?
Dialogue: 10,0:21:19.89,0:21:21.47,dialog,,0,0,0,,Mari coba sekali saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:21.64,0:21:24.18,dialog,,0,0,0,,Rasakan yang kulakukan sekarang,
Dialogue: 10,0:21:24.22,0:21:26.59,dialog,,0,0,0,,kalau berminat, terima tawaranku.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:26.84,0:21:28.84,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau tidak, aku akan menyerah.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:29.50,0:21:30.73,dialog,,0,0,0,,Baiklah kalau begitu.
Dialogue: 10,0:21:31.29,0:21:33.09,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kalau gagal, kau harus menyerah!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:33.54,0:21:35.85,dialog,,0,0,0,,Dan kalau aku menang,\Ntandingkan aku dengan pelayanmu!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:44.07,0:21:47.90,dialog,,0,0,0,,Nah, bawalah aku ke Arena Tarung Gelap!
Dialogue: 10,0:21:59.98,0:22:02.79,dialog,,0,0,0,,Kau tidak bicara yang aneh-aneh, 'kan?
Dialogue: 10,0:22:04.70,0:22:07.17,dialog,,0,0,0,,Cuma bicara yang penting saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:07.53,0:22:10.23,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ternyata Lily benaran pergi\Nke Arena Tarung Gelap, ya.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:10.26,0:22:11.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Hah?!
Dialogue: 10,0:22:14.51,0:22:15.66,dialog,,0,0,0,,Ya ampun.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:15.90,0:22:17.63,dialog,,0,0,0,,Bikin repot saja.
Dialogue: 10,0:22:18.43,0:22:21.77,dialog,,0,0,0,,Aku harus menyiapkan cara terakhir.
Dialogue: 10,0:23:55.95,0:23:59.29,dialog,,0,0,0,,Selanjutnya,\N"Menyusup ke Arena Tarung Gelap".
